I would say it's more like we'll see a $2,000 subscription this year.

1020
00:55:40,852 --> 00:55:42,616
달러짜리 구독 상품이 나올 것 같아요.

1021
00:55:42,616 --> 00:55:44,032
이미 200달러짜리 구독은 봤잖아요.
We've seen $200 subscriptions.

1022
00:55:44,032 --> 00:55:47,973
그게 또 10배가 될 수도
있고, 이런 것들이 앞으로 나올
That could 10X again, and these are the kind of things that could come, and they're all downstream of this bigger model that offers just a little bit more cutting edge. - So, you know, it's reported that xAI is gonna hit that one-gigawatt scale early '26, and a full two gigawatts by year end.

1023
00:55:47,973 --> 00:55:51,668
수 있는 일들인데, 이게 다
아주 조금 더 최첨단인 걸

