이걸 가지고 배합 과정을
거치면 답이 나오는 거예요.

1322
01:12:17,077 --> 01:12:20,748
제 생각엔 올해 여러 랩에서 이런
일이 있었던 것 같아요. 코딩
I think that's happened at labs this year; there's new hot things, whether it's coding environments or web navigation, and you need to bring in new data, change your whole pre-training so that your post-training can work better.

1323
01:12:20,748 --> 01:12:24,420
환경이든 웹 내비게이션이든 새롭게
뜨는 게 생기면, 새 데이터를

1324
