"아, 나는 RL 스케일링 하는
법을 알아냈어" 뭐 이런 식이죠.
It's like, "Oh, I figured out how to scale RL."

1349
01:13:54,798 --> 01:13:57,863
그렇게 해낸 그룹도 있긴 한데,
사실 기여의 대부분은— 데이터셋
There's a group that did that, but most of the contribution is like— - On the dataset - ..."I'm gonna make the data better," or, "I'm gonna make the infrastructure better so everyone on my team can run experiments 5% faster." - At the same time, I think it's also one of the closest guarded secrets, what your training data is, for legal reasons.

1350
01:13:57,863 --> 01:14:00,665
쪽이에요— "데이터를 더 좋게
만들겠다"라거나, "우리 팀

1351
01:14:00,665 --> 01:14:03,817
전체가 실험을 5% 더 빠르게 돌릴
수 있게 인프라를 개선하겠다"

1352
01:14:03,817 --> 01:14:06,882
같은 거죠. 동시에, 훈련 데이터가
정확히 뭔지는 법적인 이유로

1353
