법적인 이유 때문에 출처를 드러내지
않도록 모델을 훈련시키는 식이죠.
Like training the model to not give away the sources because you have legal reasons. - The other thing, to be complete, is that some people are trying to train on only licensed data, whereas Common Crawl is a scrape of the whole internet.

1357
01:14:18,876 --> 01:14:22,749
하나 더 짚자면, 어떤 사람들은
