There's another idea where you can train language models only on data that has been licensed explicitly, so that the kind of governing contract is provided, and I'm not sure if Apertus is the copyright thing or the license thing.

1364
01:14:46,773 --> 01:14:50,368
있는데, 그러면 일종의 계약 관계가
성립하는 거고요. Apertus가

