So, I do think scaling, in that sense, might be still pretty much alive if you also look in domain-specific applications, because we are still right now, in this year, just looking at general purpose LLMs on, on ChatGPT, Anthropic and so forth.

1391
01:16:29,328 --> 01:16:33,764
아직도 꽤 살아있을 수 있다고 봐요.
왜냐하면 지금 우리는, 올해까지도,

1392
