그건 그냥 범용일 뿐이고, 특정
과제에 맞춰 제대로 설계되고
They are just general purpose, they're not even, I think, scratching the surface of what an LLM can do if it is really specifically trained and designed for a specific task. - I think on the data thing—this is one of the things that happened in 2025, and we totally forget it—is Anthropic lost in court and owed $1.5 billion to authors.

1394
01:16:41,285 --> 01:16:44,921
훈련된 LLM이 뭘 할 수 있는지는
아직 수박 겉핥기도 못 한

1395
01:16:44,921 --> 01:16:48,235
것 같아요. 데이터 얘기가
나온 김에— 이건 2025년에

