수천 권 사서 스캔했는데,
Anthropic, I think, bought thousands of books and scanned them and was cleared legally for that because they bought the books, and that is kind of going through the system.

1399
01:16:58,579 --> 01:17:01,652
책을 구매했다는 이유로 그
부분은 법적으로 문제없다는

