But if you use the LLM to do everything, at some point you will never really take the next step, and then you will maybe not get that unlock that you would get as an expert using an LLM.

1736
01:36:46,078 --> 01:36:49,576
다음 단계로 나아가지 못하게
되고, 그러면 전문가로서 LLM을

