그러니까 일종의 퍼펙트
스톰이었던 거죠 — 모델이 크게
So, it was kind of this perfect storm where the models change a lot, and the way that they're trained is a major factor in doing so.

1761
01:38:11,228 --> 01:38:15,152
달라졌고, 그 변화에는 학습 방식이
