We don't take a lot of credit for being the people to popularize the scaling RL, but as fun as what academics get, as an aside, is the ability to name and influence the discourse, because the closed labs can only say so much.

1769
01:38:36,908 --> 01:38:40,481
건 아니에요. 그런데 재밌게도
— 여담이지만 — 학계 사람들이

1770
01:38:40,481 --> 01:38:44,159
누리는 것 중 하나가 용어를 짓고
담론에 영향을 미칠 수 있다는

1771
