1772
01:38:47,627 --> 01:38:50,890
그러니까 학계에 있으면 이런 걸
할 수 있어요 — 모델을 학습시킬
That one of the things you can do as an academic is you might not have the compute to train the model, but you can frame things in a way that ends up being described as a community coming together around this RLVR term, which is very fun.

1773
01:38:50,890 --> 01:38:54,061
연산력은 없어도, 어떤 걸
프레이밍하는 건 할 수 있다는 거죠.

1774
01:38:54,061 --> 01:38:57,143
그렇게 해서 결국 커뮤니티가
