그러니까 강화학습이란
고전적으로는, 에이전트가 환경
So reinforcement learning is classically an agent that acts in an environment, and the environment gives it a state and a reward back, and you try to maximize this reward.

1781
01:39:19,749 --> 01:39:23,249
안에서 행동하고 환경이 그
