That is also, in some ways, verifiable, or constraints on your instruction, like respond only with words that start with A." All of these things are verifiable in some way, and the core idea of this is you find a lot more of these problems that are verifiable and you let the model try it many times while taking these RL steps, these RL gradient updates.

