The infrastructure evolved from reinforcement learning from human feedback, where in that era the score they were trying to optimize was a learned reward model of human preferences.

1793
01:40:08,186 --> 01:40:13,574
그 시절엔 최적화하려던 점수가 인간
선호도를 학습한 보상 모델이었어요.

1794
01:40:13,574 --> 01:40:17,681
그러니까 문제 영역 자체를 좀 바꾸신
