They use more tokens, so it becomes more expensive.

1832
01:42:32,339 --> 01:42:34,309
간단한 작업에도 비용이 커지긴 하는데,
It becomes expensive for simple tasks, but these explanations help accuracy.

1833
01:42:34,309 --> 01:42:36,280
이런 설명들이 정확도에는 도움이 돼요.

1834
