1837
01:42:48,851 --> 01:42:51,225
그리고 이것도—다시 한번
말씀드리지만, 이 LLM들을
And I think it's also—again, I don't want to anthropomorphize these LLMs, but it's kind of like how we humans operate.

1838
01:42:51,225 --> 01:42:53,272
의인화하고 싶진 않은데요,
그래도 어쩐지 우리

1839
