LLM이 인간처럼 사고하는 건 아니지만,
Although LLMs don't think like humans, it's kind of like an interesting coincidence and it...

1851
01:43:28,731 --> 01:43:31,083
어떻게 보면 흥미로운 우연이고 그게...

1852
