제 생각엔 요즘은 다들 좀 더
신중하고 점진적으로 가는 것 같아요.
I think people are a little bit more cautious and incremental now. - So RLVR is more, let's say, unlimited in how much you can train or still get benefit, where RLHF, because it's a preference tuning, you reach a certain point where it doesn't really make sense to spend more RL budget on that.

2033
01:53:08,675 --> 01:53:12,720
- RLVR은 말하자면 아무리
