그러니까 원래 트랜스포머로 돌아가
보면, 인코더랑 디코더가 있었잖아요.
Like, when you go back to the original transformer, they were the encoder and the decoder.

2685
02:30:35,575 --> 02:30:39,322
디코더가 지금 GPT 같은
모델들에서 쓰이는 방식이에요.
The decoder is what we are using right now in GPT and so forth.

2686
02:30:39,322 --> 02:30:43,403
인코더는 좀 더 병렬적인
기법에 가까운데,
The encoder is more like a parallel technique where you have multiple tokens that you fill in in parallel.

2687
02:30:43,403 --> 02:30:47,129
여러 토큰을 한꺼번에 채워 넣는 거죠.

2688
02:30:47,129 --> 02:30:50,241
GPT 모델들은
자기회귀(autoregressive) 방식으로
GPT models, they do autoregressive generation, completing the sentence one token at a time.

2689
