그래서 요지는, 어떤 원격 근무
시나리오에도 들어갈 수 있는
So the idea is, if we are going to actually get to something that is a true, general adaptable intelligence that can go into any remote work scenario, it needs to be able to learn quickly from feedback and on-the-job learning.

2844
02:39:52,010 --> 02:39:56,218
진짜 범용적이고 적응 가능한
지능에 도달하려면, 피드백을 통해서

