The problem is you can't just do that for each person because it would be too expensive to update the weights for each person, and I think that's the problem.

2884
02:42:12,785 --> 02:42:16,992
업데이트하는 건 너무 비용이 많이
들 테니까요. 그게 문제라고 봐요.

2885
